{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:55:44+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:55:44+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"ENAV S.p.A.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airports & Air Services","country":"Italy","city":"Rome","website":"https://www.enav.it","employees":4574,"summary":"ENAV S.p.A. provides air traffic control and management, and other air navigation services in Italy, the rest of Europe, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Air Navigation Services, Maintenance Services, and Aeronautical Information Management (AIM) Software Solutions. The company offers technical management and maintenance services for air traffic control equipment and systems, as well as for air infrastructure. It also develops software solutions for the management of aeronautical information and air traffic; and provides associated commercial and maintenance services. In addition, the company offers air traffic flow management, air traffic management and weather, communication navigation and surveillance, digital aeronautical information management, flight procedure design and validation, and unmanned aircraft system traffic management. Further, it provides consultancy for change management, aeronautical information, engineering and maintenance, education and training, meteorology, in flight control and validation, safety assessment and risk management; and evaluation of obstacle and electromagnetic interference services. It serves airport management and airlines companies, air navigation service providers, industries, civil aviation, and research and development industries. The company was founded in 2001 and is based in Rome, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"ENAV S.p.A. assure le contrôle et la gestion du trafic aérien, ainsi que d’autres services de navigation aérienne en Italie, dans le reste de l’Europe et à l’international. Elle opère sur trois segments : les services de navigation aérienne, les services de maintenance et les solutions logicielles de gestion de l'information aéronautique (AIM). La société offre des services techniques de gestion et de maintenance pour les équipements et systèmes de contrôle de la circulation aérienne, ainsi que pour les infrastructures aériennes."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2766465280,"shares_outstanding":540325280,"trailing_pe":25.599998,"forward_pe":22.859184,"price_to_book":2.675026,"ev_to_ebitda":11.246,"ev_to_revenue":2.933,"dividend_yield":0.0571,"payout_ratio":1.45,"beta_yahoo":0.636},"targets":{"current_price":5.12,"mean":5.18571,"median":5.3,"high":6.2,"low":3.9,"n_analysts":7,"reco_mean":2.57143,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-08-03"],"eps_avg":0.12619,"eps_low":0.12619,"eps_high":0.12619,"revenue_avg":320447470,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-22","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.53279996,"institutions_pct":0.2191,"institutions_float_pct":0.46897,"institutions_n":131,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Global Infrastructure ETF","pct":0.02,"shares":10831193,"value":55455706,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0462},{"name":"MFS Series Trust V-MFS International New Discovery Fund","pct":0.011,"shares":5949642,"value":30462166,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0217},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0066000004,"shares":3574256,"value":18300190,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0045,"shares":2432976,"value":12456836,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0275},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0034,"shares":1849642,"value":9470166,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0139999995},{"name":"Principal Funds, Inc-Diversified Real Asset Fund","pct":0.0021,"shares":1141141,"value":5842641,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.1039},{"name":"SPDR INDEX SHARES